The '''Cutting Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Cuts hides into cloth, and large materials into workable components.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CuttingWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Cutting</code>.

